#### 3. Component Utilities

**File**: [dashboard/js/components.js](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/dashboard/js/components.js)

**Functions**:

##### [calculateSignalStrength(signal)](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/dashboard/js/components.js#3-28)
Calculates 0-100% strength based on:
- R:R ratio (30%)
- Sentiment alignment (20%)
- Not blocked by news (30%)
- Base quality (20%)

##### [createSentimentGauge(canvasId, score)](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/dashboard/js/components.js#75-113)
Creates Chart.js doughnut chart (180° arc) for sentiment visualization:
- Score: -1.0 to +1.0
- Color: Red (bearish) → Yellow (neutral) → Green (bullish)

##### [createSignalCard(instrument, signal)](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/dashboard/js/components.js#114-213)
Generates HTML for signal card including:
- Instrument name & timeframe
- Direction badge
- Price levels (entry, stop, TP1, TP2)
- Risk metrics (R:R, risk %)
- News status indicator
- Signal strength bar
- Sentiment gauge
- Timestamp

##### [formatPrice(price, instrument)](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/dashboard/js/components.js#59-74)
Intelligent price formatting:
- Forex: 5 decimals
- JPY pairs: 3 decimals
- Gold/Indices: 2 decimals

##### [formatRelativeTime(timestamp)](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/dashboard/js/components.js#38-58)
Human-readable timestamps:
- "Just now"
- "5m ago"
- "2h ago"
- "3d ago"

