## Known Limitations

1. **No WebSocket**: Using polling (10s interval), not real-time push
2. **No signal history**: Only shows latest signal per instrument
3. **No trade execution**: Display only, no trading actions
4. **No custom alerts**: Planned for future version
5. **Chart.js dependency**: Requires CDN (offline fallback needed)

